      "sections.horoscope": "Drafted as কোষ্ঠী বিবরণ; কুষ্ঠি / জন্মছক are also used. Bengali biodatas often add গণ (দেব/নর/রাক্ষস); the Gan field (Step 2.0) covers it.",
